# BioCraft — Supabase (guest-first, database-only phase).
#
# 1. Restore the Supabase project (dashboard → project → "Restore project").
# 2. Create a publishable key (Project Settings → API Keys → Publishable keys).
# 3. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the two values below.
# 4. For production, set the same two variables in Vercel → Project →
#    Settings → Environment Variables (Production + Preview).
#
# The publishable (anon) key is safe to expose in the browser — it is
# designed to be public and is limited by Row Level Security to read-only
# access of active content. The service_role key must NEVER be used here.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_REPLACE_ME
